export anchor MonochromeMinimalStyle:
    number: 12
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Monochrome minimal
    idea: Black, white and grey only, one weight, hairlines and a great deal of empty space, so the content itself is the only thing that carries weight.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and the secondary button
        ink: #111111, text, the primary button, this week's chart marks and list top rules
        grey: #595959, labels, meta text and chart axes
        mid: #8c8c8c, last week's chart marks only
        rule: #d4d4d4, field lines, dividers and progress tracks
        hair: #ececec, row separators and section dividers
        wash: #f4f4f4, the fill of a focused row
    type:
        One family at weight 400 only, -apple-system, Helvetica Neue,
        Helvetica, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif. Sizes are
        72px summary figures with tight letter spacing, a 48px headline,
        16px names and lead text, 14px body at 1.6 line height and 12px grey
        labels. Bold is never used, and hierarchy comes from size alone.
    layout:
        A 96px header line with a lowercase wordmark, 12px nav words with a
        1px underline on the current one, an underlined search, notification
        and user words and a black New project button. The page is a run of
        full-width bands split by hairlines, each with a 12px label in a
        240px left column and the content on the right. The bands are the
        greeting, the four figures split by thin vertical rules, the
        numbered project list, and the chart beside the activity list.
        Content is capped at 1200px with 48px side gutters. Below 1100px the
        label sits above its content. Below 820px the nav moves to its own
        row, the figures form a two by two grid and each project shows its
        progress and facts under its name.
    spacing: An 8px unit used in large steps, 96px band padding, 48px gutters and 72px project rows.
    density: Very low. One idea per band, and the page scrolls rather than crowds.
    corners: None.
    borders: 1px only, #ececec between rows, #d4d4d4 for fields and dividers and #111111 to open a list.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        No pictograms. Status is a 10px geometric mark beside its word, an
        open circle for On track, an open triangle for At risk and a solid
        square for Behind. Progress is a 1px track with a 3px black fill.
        The chart is thin stems with open dots for last week and solid dots
        for this week.
    focus: A 1px ink outline offset 4px. A focused field gets a doubled ink underline, and a focused row gets the wash fill and a 1px ink outline.
    tone: Quiet and plain, with full stops and few words, such as Good morning, Mara. and Everything else is moving.
